=== 1. Certificat mkcert et mots de passe (dossier .local/, ignoré par Git) ===

Created a new certificate valid for the following names 📜
 - "*.127.0.0.1.sslip.io"

Reminder: X.509 wildcards only go one level deep, so this won't match a.b.127.0.0.1.sslip.io ℹ️

The certificate is at ".local/certs/tls.crt" and the key at ".local/certs/tls.key" ✅

It will expire on 3 February 2029 🗓

Mots de passe générés dans .local/secrets/ (4 utilisateurs du realm, PostgreSQL, administrateur initial de Keycloak ; non affichés).

